<title>INDONESIA: BADMINTON- GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON- GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the complete results on the first day of the World Grand Prix Badminton Finals on Wednesday. The tournament is being played in Denpasar on the Indonesian holiday isle of Bali.</p>
<p>Men's singles:</p>
<p>Indra Wijaya (Indonesia) bt Dong Jiong (China) 15-12 15-5</p>
<p>Alan Budikusuma (Indonesia) bt Budi Santoso (Indonesia) 6-15</p>
<p>15-7 15-10</p>
<p>Poul-Erik Hoyer-Larsen (Denmark) bt Hu Zhilan (China) 13-15</p>
<p>15-12 15-18</p>
<p>Rashid Sidek (Malaysia) bt Soren Nielsen (Denmark) 15-10 15-1</p>
<p>Ong Ewe Hock (Malaysia) bt Thomas Stuer-Lauridsen (Denmark)</p>
<p>12-15 15-11 15-4</p>
<p>Joko Suprianto (Indonesia) bt Cheng Gang (China) 11-15 17-14</p>
<p>15-9</p>
<p>Women's singles:</p>
<p>Mia Audina (Indonesia) bt Christina Gandrup (Sweden) 11-3</p>
<p>11-1</p>
<p>Ye Zhaoying (China) bt Yao Yan (China) 11-7 11-1</p>
<p>Wang Chen (China) bt Lidya Djaelawidjaya (Indonesia) 11-1</p>
<p>13-11</p>
<p>Men's doubles:</p>
<p>Cheah Soon Kit/Yap Kim Hock (Malaysia) bt Peter</p>
<p>Axelsson/Par-Gunnar Jonsson (Sweden) 15-12 6-15 15-5</p>
<p>Women's doubles:</p>
<p>Eliza/Zelin Rosiana (Indonesia) bt Helene Kirkegaard/Rikke</p>
<p>Olsen (Denmark) 15-12 15-6</p>
<p>Ge Fei/Gu Jun (China) bt Nicola Beck/Joanne Davies (Britian)</p>
<p>15-4 15-0</p>
<p>Mixed doubles:</p>
<p>Nick Ponting/Joanne Goode (Britian) bt Flandy Limpele/Risyeu</p>
<p>Rosalina (Indonesia) 15-10 15-8</p>
</text>
